WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:02.980
You two look like a couple.

3
00:02.980 --> 00:05.780
Is there something going on?

4
00:06.670 --> 00:08.320
Oh! I'm sorry.

5
00:08.320 --> 00:11.940
The path is pretty wide. Did you do that on purpose?

6
00:11.940 --> 00:13.190
Why did you follow me here?

7
00:13.190 --> 00:15.440
Did I? I was jogging after practice.

8
00:15.440 --> 00:17.440
You should apply to be a trainee at the soccer club.

9
00:17.440 --> 00:20.000
The team really needs extra hands.

10
00:21.170 --> 00:23.800
The two of us are dating.

11
00:23.800 --> 00:25.644
Hey.

12
00:26.590 --> 00:29.577
Why do I have to see you everywhere?

13
00:29.577 --> 00:31.866
I've been feeling a bit uneasy lately, Jinna. [Go to hell]

14
00:31.866 --> 00:34.133
Anyway, be careful for now, Anda.

15
00:34.133 --> 00:36.240
This clearly was sent with bad intentions.

16
00:36.240 --> 00:37.400
Podduang.

17
00:37.400 --> 00:38.711
Wake up. You're home.

18
00:38.711 --> 00:40.620
Yes, baby.

19
00:42.170 --> 00:44.155
He's really out cold?

20
01:36.040 --> 01:38.955
Your stir-fried veggies are here, baby.

21
02:29.180 --> 02:30.980
- Not even going to wait? - What?

22
02:30.980 --> 02:33.560
Are you going to follow me everywhere or what?

23
02:33.560 --> 02:36.630
I'm sorry, dear.

24
02:36.630 --> 02:38.580
I'm not... I'm leaving the elevator.

25
02:38.580 --> 02:39.600
I'm so sorry.

26
02:39.600 --> 02:40.680
- I'm sorry, ma'am. - Right.

27
02:40.680 --> 02:43.022
Right, right. I'm sorry.

28
02:53.420 --> 02:54.770
Hey, Podduang.

29
02:54.770 --> 02:56.920
I saw a young man drop you off last night.

30
02:56.920 --> 03:00.220
So dope. Awesome stuff.

31
03:22.360 --> 03:25.520
Are you the one who called a ride to the university?

32
03:25.520 --> 03:27.377
Yes.

33
03:27.377 --> 03:29.290
Hop on, kiddo.

34
03:38.920 --> 03:41.730
[Characters, places, and incidents in this production]

35
03:41.730 --> 03:43.688
[are entirely fictitious.]

36
03:43.688 --> 03:47.020
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

37
05:11.820 --> 05:14.866
You did so well, you know?

38
05:14.866 --> 05:18.666
But don't watch the next scene, Kum.

39
05:18.666 --> 05:21.000
Why not?

40
05:21.000 --> 05:23.111
It makes me flustered.

41
05:24.680 --> 05:28.000
Let's watch it, then?

42
05:35.640 --> 05:38.280
No, don't.

43
05:44.720 --> 05:47.060
Totally killed it.

44
05:47.060 --> 05:49.330
I told you not to watch it.

45
05:50.070 --> 05:53.270
You're so different from your character in the series.

46
05:53.270 --> 05:55.111
What?

47
05:56.777 --> 05:59.822
- Are you jealous? - Nothing.

48
06:01.060 --> 06:04.822
I know how to make it up to you.

49
06:18.422 --> 06:19.760
See?

50
06:19.760 --> 06:22.490
You're teasing this old dog's heart again.

51
06:26.360 --> 06:28.510
What do you mean?

52
06:28.510 --> 06:30.288
A short ad break first.

53
06:32.466 --> 06:34.355
Give me a second.

54
06:38.830 --> 06:42.688
Ta-da. For you.

55
06:42.688 --> 06:45.400
- What is it? - Open it.

56
06:49.520 --> 06:51.440
[Anda]

57
06:54.880 --> 06:57.800
- Whoa. - Do you like it?

58
06:58.800 --> 07:00.910
This is lovely.

59
07:01.950 --> 07:04.860
Notice the number right here.

60
07:08.222 --> 07:10.480
This is really sweet.

61
07:13.355 --> 07:15.720
You're my first Andaman.

62
07:19.710 --> 07:23.311
With this,

63
07:23.980 --> 07:26.644
how should I reward my good boy?

64
07:26.644 --> 07:28.644
What's the reward?

65
07:33.600 --> 07:35.520
Just keep watching the series.

66
07:35.520 --> 07:36.850
We're about to reach the climax.

67
07:36.850 --> 07:39.450
- Are we now? - The climax in...

68
07:39.450 --> 07:42.060
We're about to reach the climax, right?

69
07:42.060 --> 07:43.610
The tension's rising.

70
07:43.610 --> 07:47.422
What? That's not what I mean, Kum.

71
07:48.755 --> 07:51.266
Stop it.

72
08:00.570 --> 08:03.570
Well, thank you very much, everyone, for making it here today.

73
08:03.570 --> 08:08.220
I'm really excited that we'll get to watch the ending together.

74
08:08.220 --> 08:12.410
How do you feel about the series still going so strong right now,

75
08:12.410 --> 08:16.688
while also trending at number one in both Thailand and neighboring countries?

76
08:16.688 --> 08:18.220
I'm so delighted.

77
08:18.220 --> 08:23.130
And thank you for all the support you've given us both.

78
08:23.130 --> 08:29.090
Is it true that you and Anda are about to release merchandise for fans to collect?

79
08:29.090 --> 08:34.844
Can you give us a little sneak peek at what it will look like?

80
08:34.844 --> 08:38.290
I believe our fans will love it.

81
08:38.290 --> 08:42.288
Here's a hint: you can combine two parts into one.

82
08:44.430 --> 08:45.680
How sweet!

83
08:45.680 --> 08:51.350
One more thing. There are only 100 of these, everyone.

84
08:51.350 --> 08:54.130
If you want to get your hands on one, tonight at 7 p.m.,

85
08:54.130 --> 08:56.377
click the link on the series' social media pages.

86
08:56.377 --> 09:00.640
After three series together, when will you two finally make it official?

87
09:04.000 --> 09:05.950
When should we announce it?

88
09:12.540 --> 09:14.444
What is this?

89
09:36.650 --> 09:38.488
Anda?

90
09:42.533 --> 09:45.866
You don't need to go full incognito like this.

91
09:48.400 --> 09:50.755
I want to stay by your side.

92
09:50.755 --> 09:53.180
I miss you, Kum.

93
09:53.180 --> 09:55.530
Don't give me that smile.

94
09:55.530 --> 09:57.910
Make sure to get some rest, okay?

95
09:57.910 --> 10:01.330
I've got you right here, my good source of rest.

96
10:01.330 --> 10:03.690
Come and let me recharge.

97
10:03.690 --> 10:05.540
What are you doing?

98
10:07.511 --> 10:09.380
Nobody will see us.

99
10:09.380 --> 10:13.444
I hopped in Chai's van and had him drive around the parking lot so many times.

100
10:13.444 --> 10:16.911
Then I got changed and came here. Rest assured.

101
10:17.730 --> 10:20.090
Seems like a total hassle, doesn't it?

102
10:20.090 --> 10:22.840
It does.

103
10:22.840 --> 10:25.780
That's why I deserve a reward.

104
10:25.780 --> 10:27.511
What are you doing?

105
10:27.511 --> 10:30.866
Come on. The windows are tinted. No one can see us.

106
10:39.511 --> 10:41.355
Kum.

107
10:42.422 --> 10:44.720
I want to go public.

108
10:45.790 --> 10:47.710
Is that a good idea, Anda?

109
10:47.710 --> 10:49.830
This might affect your career.

110
10:49.830 --> 10:52.870
I'm just done dating you in secret.

111
10:52.870 --> 10:56.860
I won't have to go full incognito like I've been doing either.

112
10:56.860 --> 10:59.130
You're gaining popularity, Anda.

113
10:59.130 --> 11:02.088
You're rising to fame.

114
11:02.088 --> 11:06.250
I don't think we have to go public.

115
11:06.250 --> 11:08.740
I'm fine as it is.

116
11:08.740 --> 11:11.230
But isn't it uncomfortable?

117
11:11.230 --> 11:14.622
Not being able to be ourselves?

118
11:14.622 --> 11:17.800
Your family isn't okay with this, are they?

119
11:17.800 --> 11:23.377
Your father hasn't been in touch with you since you started working on a series.

120
11:25.770 --> 11:28.800
Hey, Anda.

121
11:28.800 --> 11:31.000
I'll leave this to you.

122
11:31.000 --> 11:35.210
I can handle it just fine myself.

123
11:35.210 --> 11:37.700
You can take your time.

124
11:37.700 --> 11:43.622
For me, simply being with you is already enough to make me happy.

125
11:44.530 --> 11:46.460
See?

126
11:46.460 --> 11:48.220
You're always like this.

127
11:48.220 --> 11:50.800
How can I not love this old dog?

128
11:54.000 --> 11:55.866
Kiss me.

129
11:59.110 --> 12:01.150
Let's hit the road now.

130
12:08.380 --> 12:11.711
Podduang, are you sure your internet connection is fast enough?

131
12:11.711 --> 12:13.730
It's slowing down because of Dunk.

132
12:13.730 --> 12:16.660
- He's glued to his soccer game. - Dunk, turn it off already.

133
12:16.660 --> 12:19.160
Hey, what the hell? The match is just as important.

134
12:19.160 --> 12:22.470
Right now, there's nothing as important as the 100 figurines.

135
12:22.470 --> 12:24.422
You're so right.

136
12:25.000 --> 12:26.911
30 seconds left.

137
12:26.911 --> 12:30.155
If I reset the router right now, would you be mad at me?

138
12:30.155 --> 12:32.600
- Shut up! - Shut it!

139
12:32.600 --> 12:34.820
Why not make more if you knew it'd sell?

140
12:34.820 --> 12:36.422
Ten.

141
12:36.422 --> 12:38.000
Nine.

142
12:38.000 --> 12:39.355
Eight.

143
12:39.355 --> 12:40.960
[Surfer boy] Seven.

144
12:40.960 --> 12:42.266
- Six. - Six.

145
12:42.266 --> 12:43.580
- Five. - Five.

146
12:43.580 --> 12:45.622
- Four, three. - Four, three.

147
12:45.622 --> 12:46.777
[Buy It Now] - Two. - Two.

148
12:46.777 --> 12:48.440
- One. - One.

149
12:48.440 --> 12:49.840
[Error] [Sorry, the website is temporarily unavailable]

150
12:49.840 --> 12:51.570
Damn it.

151
12:51.570 --> 12:53.311
It always happens to me.

152
12:53.311 --> 12:56.460
What? What's happening? What the fuck happened?

153
12:56.460 --> 12:58.133
Why are you all quiet? I'm nervous, okay?

154
12:58.133 --> 12:59.110
[SOLD OUT]

155
12:59.110 --> 13:03.840
My limited-edition collection is fucking sold out!

156
13:03.840 --> 13:05.100
I'm so upset, Bum.

157
13:05.100 --> 13:07.777
No...

158
13:07.777 --> 13:10.130
Don't touch me!

159
13:11.030 --> 13:14.266
She's pissed. Better leave her be.

160
13:17.460 --> 13:19.450
Who the hell is that?

161
13:21.430 --> 13:23.420
I'm so sad...

162
13:30.333 --> 13:31.840
Who is it?

163
13:31.840 --> 13:34.800
What's wrong? You're acting like it's Jinna.

164
13:43.044 --> 13:46.488
Did you forget about your order? You didn't answer my calls.

165
13:47.266 --> 13:49.622
Sorry.

166
13:49.622 --> 13:51.630
Jinna!

167
13:51.630 --> 13:54.600
You're such a hard worker, delivering food even on your day off.

168
13:54.600 --> 13:56.222
How many jobs do you have?

169
13:56.222 --> 13:58.330
He reminds me of Chief Hong from 'Hometown Cha-Cha-Cha.'

170
13:58.330 --> 13:59.990
I never knew people like this existed.

171
13:59.990 --> 14:02.066
Come and hang out with us.

172
14:03.360 --> 14:04.840
I have other work to do.

173
14:04.840 --> 14:06.960
See you at the soccer club.

174
14:22.840 --> 14:25.355
Dunk, why are you inviting him in?

175
14:25.355 --> 14:26.710
This is my place!

176
14:26.710 --> 14:30.177
Sorry, I was being too friendly.

177
14:31.590 --> 14:32.950
Hey, come on now.

178
14:32.950 --> 14:35.340
Let's have dinner.

179
14:35.340 --> 14:37.288
Yours first.

180
14:37.288 --> 14:40.640
- What is it? - I don't know.

181
14:48.960 --> 14:52.480
[Anda Confirms His Relationship with Non-Celebrity Partner!]

182
15:04.510 --> 15:05.710
Hello, Podduang?

183
15:05.710 --> 15:07.840
Hello, Bum. Have you seen the news?

184
15:07.840 --> 15:11.700
I have. I was actually about to call you.

185
15:11.700 --> 15:14.222
What made you decide to make such a bold move?

186
15:14.222 --> 15:20.510
I believe the series I've worked on taught me that "love has no bounds."

187
15:20.510 --> 15:25.690
And I want everyone to know that I stand by the message

188
15:25.690 --> 15:29.380
that this is who I really am.

189
15:29.380 --> 15:33.840
I wanted to come on this show first

190
15:33.840 --> 15:37.355
to remind everyone that we all deserve to love

191
15:37.355 --> 15:39.822
and be loved in our own way.

192
15:39.822 --> 15:44.488
Are you worried your popularity might fade after going public?

193
15:44.488 --> 15:48.440
This has been something I've thought about for a long time.

194
15:49.330 --> 15:53.660
But I've thought it through. I think it's worth it.

195
15:53.660 --> 15:58.711
I also believe the fans of the series and the Andaman fandom will understand.

196
15:58.711 --> 16:02.300
Have you consulted anyone before making the announcement?

197
16:03.100 --> 16:04.350
I consulted my partner.

198
16:04.350 --> 16:07.410
Is your partner a celebrity or a non-celebrity?

199
16:07.410 --> 16:09.210
Non-celebrity.

200
16:09.210 --> 16:12.511
- A pilot. - A pilot?

201
16:13.088 --> 16:15.488
What did your family say about this?

202
16:19.230 --> 16:21.100
I hope they'll understand me.

203
16:21.100 --> 16:23.010
[#AndaIsNotManly]

204
16:23.010 --> 16:24.333
[The sausage-fest will rule the world.]

205
16:24.333 --> 16:25.800
[Coming out takes courage. Why bully them?]

206
16:25.800 --> 16:26.930
[Mess with my baby, mess with me.]

207
16:26.930 --> 16:27.933
[I heard he got fucked by a soccer player]

208
16:27.933 --> 16:28.844
[Your words reflect your upbringing]

209
16:28.844 --> 16:30.490
[We're so proud of you. #AndaAndHisSmile]

210
16:30.490 --> 16:32.310
This isn't good.

211
16:32.310 --> 16:35.733
So many people reposted my tweets. All I see are homophobes.

212
16:35.733 --> 16:40.111
A lot of the fans are showing him support, though.

213
16:40.111 --> 16:42.044
There's nothing we can do.

214
16:42.044 --> 16:43.866
We don't even know how Anda is holding up.

215
16:43.866 --> 16:45.800
Yeah.

216
16:49.660 --> 16:54.488
So... How are you and Dunk doing?

217
16:54.488 --> 16:59.130
Well... It's going alright.

218
16:59.130 --> 17:01.510
We've gotten used to each other.

219
17:01.510 --> 17:04.044
It feels like we're more like friends than anything.

220
17:04.044 --> 17:06.320
It's hard to explain.

221
17:08.560 --> 17:11.111
Podduang. Honestly,

222
17:11.111 --> 17:15.070
I'm a little uncomfortable about dating Dunk.

223
17:15.070 --> 17:17.840
I'm so afraid.

224
17:17.840 --> 17:22.180
From our first year until now, we know what we're like.

225
17:22.180 --> 17:24.700
You know what I'm like.

226
17:24.700 --> 17:27.640
My love life always comes crashing down.

227
17:28.460 --> 17:31.340
I think this one's on me, really.

228
17:32.888 --> 17:35.500
It probably won't be the case with Dunk.

229
17:35.500 --> 17:38.377
Don't know. Don't want to think about it.

230
17:38.377 --> 17:41.488
You've been his crush since freshman year.

231
17:41.488 --> 17:43.350
And what about you?

232
17:43.350 --> 17:45.777
When did he become your crush?

233
17:52.410 --> 17:54.570
I care about you, Podduang.

234
17:54.570 --> 17:57.111
I care so much about our group.

235
17:58.630 --> 18:01.250
Me too.

236
18:01.250 --> 18:05.840
But as for your relationship, I'm actually okay with it.

237
18:05.840 --> 18:08.090
Don't worry, Bum.

238
18:37.111 --> 18:40.840
Your phone's out of juice. Now, you can look up the chords.

239
18:40.840 --> 18:42.670
Hey, it's okay. I'm leaving soon.

240
18:42.670 --> 18:44.030
Come on, just take it.

241
18:44.030 --> 18:49.222
If you rent a portable charger here, you can return it at any station.

242
18:53.466 --> 18:55.020
Okay.

243
18:55.020 --> 18:57.688
What's wrong, Podduang?

244
18:59.230 --> 19:01.640
You don't look okay, Podduang.

245
19:04.490 --> 19:06.840
It's not about that, Bum.

246
19:07.600 --> 19:10.180
What? Why am I out of the loop?

247
19:10.180 --> 19:12.600
It's within the Andaman fandom.

248
19:17.140 --> 19:19.333
It's about my internship hours with the core team.

249
19:19.333 --> 19:21.210
I still don't know which team I should join.

250
19:21.210 --> 19:23.700
I told you to join the soccer team with me. Why complicate things?

251
19:23.700 --> 19:25.140
No way!

252
19:25.140 --> 19:27.430
I hate Jinna.

253
19:27.430 --> 19:28.990
I'll join the basketball team.

254
19:28.990 --> 19:30.360
It's already full. Where have you been?

255
19:30.360 --> 19:32.020
- And the volleyball team? - Also full!

256
19:32.020 --> 19:33.630
- The rugby team doesn't sound so bad. - Full!

257
19:33.630 --> 19:35.730
- The swimming team? - Also full!

258
19:35.730 --> 19:38.911
What now? Do I have to be with the chess team?

259
19:39.590 --> 19:43.755
That team's not full, but it's not on the list.

260
19:47.840 --> 19:51.110
Though I think the soccer team isn't a bad idea.

261
19:51.110 --> 19:53.260
Jinna isn't that bad of a guy.

262
19:53.260 --> 19:55.840
Dunk is on the team, too. I always come to watch him play.

263
19:55.840 --> 19:57.560
You won't be lonely.

264
19:59.350 --> 20:00.840
Do you guys notice something?

265
20:00.840 --> 20:04.650
Whenever we have a problem, we always sit on this damn bench.

266
20:04.650 --> 20:06.340
Should I just break it?

267
20:06.340 --> 20:08.230
Nonsense.

268
20:11.920 --> 20:13.840
[DOT: DREAMS OF TOMORROW]

269
20:20.400 --> 20:21.977
You almost bumped into me and ran off again.

270
20:21.977 --> 20:23.990
Is Coach Kong here?

271
20:23.990 --> 20:26.022
You came.

272
20:26.022 --> 20:29.711
At this rate, who's actually following whom, I wonder?

273
20:29.711 --> 20:32.220
I joined the club because my friend is on the team.

274
20:32.220 --> 20:34.510
I didn't want to see you.

275
20:34.510 --> 20:38.444
On top of that, it's almost time to submit the document.

276
20:38.444 --> 20:41.040
I don't want to intern next semester.

277
20:46.840 --> 20:48.200
I already knew that.

278
20:48.200 --> 20:51.020
You explained it like something was up.

279
20:56.620 --> 20:58.533
Why are you getting on my nerves so much?

280
20:58.533 --> 21:00.590
I'm getting on your nerves?

281
21:00.590 --> 21:03.650
You're the only one who doesn't like me.

282
21:03.650 --> 21:07.266
Be honest. Are you mad at me or what?

283
21:11.410 --> 21:13.977
Or am I making you blush?

284
21:14.970 --> 21:16.630
Alright, everyone.

285
21:16.630 --> 21:19.222
This is an intern from the Faculty of Sports and Health Science,

286
21:19.222 --> 21:21.533
who will assist you this semester.

287
21:21.533 --> 21:24.080
Give him a round of applause to welcome him.

288
21:28.840 --> 21:30.640
Take care of him, everyone.

289
21:53.920 --> 21:55.680
Hey, pick up the pace. Keep it up.

290
21:55.680 --> 21:56.810
Keep the triangle going.

291
21:56.810 --> 21:59.800
There, there. That's up, back, and then through.

292
22:42.688 --> 22:44.511
Podduang.

293
22:46.220 --> 22:48.580
What is it, Bum?

294
22:48.580 --> 22:50.822
You seem pretty quiet.

295
22:51.511 --> 22:54.311
I'm sorry if I'm misunderstanding you,

296
22:54.311 --> 22:57.244
but I think you're lying to me.

297
22:58.700 --> 23:00.980
I'm fine, really.

298
23:01.711 --> 23:06.288
I feel like I'm hurting your feelings.

299
23:06.288 --> 23:09.640
I'm willing to go back to just being friends with Dunk, Podduang.

300
23:09.640 --> 23:13.377
If there's something you're not okay with, you can just tell me.

301
23:13.377 --> 23:16.130
I'm serious.

302
23:16.130 --> 23:22.155
Bum, calm down and listen to me.

303
23:24.080 --> 23:28.533
I just used to have a crush on Dunk.

304
23:28.533 --> 23:31.050
But I'm okay now.

305
23:31.888 --> 23:34.090
Do you understand where I'm coming from?

306
23:34.090 --> 23:38.111
I've been disappointed by this kind of thing so many times.

307
23:38.111 --> 23:42.600
And I don't want to disappoint or have problems with my two best friends.

308
23:44.333 --> 23:47.620
I've got someone I like now.

309
23:49.866 --> 23:51.777
I'm sorry?

310
23:53.600 --> 23:55.355
Well...

311
23:55.355 --> 23:57.622
We've started seeing each other.

312
23:57.622 --> 23:59.555
Who is it?

313
24:01.222 --> 24:02.690
It's Jinna.

314
24:02.690 --> 24:05.311
Jinna?

315
24:06.044 --> 24:09.333
Jinna? Which Jinna?

316
24:09.333 --> 24:11.580
It's that Jinna, alright?

317
24:12.820 --> 24:14.711
The Jinna.

318
24:36.630 --> 24:37.970
Damn it...

319
24:37.970 --> 24:40.400
What did I just tell her?

320
24:49.970 --> 24:52.790
Please, calm down, honey.

321
25:15.820 --> 25:17.190
Anda.

322
25:17.190 --> 25:19.250
Why did you come home so early?

323
25:19.250 --> 25:21.230
I want to see you, Mom.

324
25:21.230 --> 25:24.822
Gosh. You know what your dad is like lately.

325
25:30.330 --> 25:32.320
And what about you?

326
25:32.970 --> 25:38.533
Are you okay with what I said in the announcement?

327
25:39.330 --> 25:42.690
You already know how I feel.

328
25:42.690 --> 25:45.820
I still love you like I always have,

329
25:45.820 --> 25:49.330
but you need to find some time to talk to your dad.

330
25:50.110 --> 25:55.250
But I think it's best to wait until he's a bit calmer.

331
25:55.250 --> 25:59.888
Am I so wrong for being who I am?

332
26:13.820 --> 26:17.440
And does your brother know about this?

333
26:17.440 --> 26:19.488
He doesn't.

334
26:19.488 --> 26:23.000
I hope Itti will understand me.

335
27:28.520 --> 27:32.040
Everyone's left. Need something?

336
27:32.040 --> 27:36.040
- Jinna, I... - You like me?

337
27:36.040 --> 27:39.960
Not that. I don't like you.

338
27:40.680 --> 27:43.110
And there's no way I would.

339
27:43.110 --> 27:45.270
Why did you say that, then?

340
27:45.270 --> 27:47.580
I just...

341
27:48.310 --> 27:50.800
I just want to make my best friend feel better.

342
27:50.800 --> 27:53.288
By lying about seeing me?

343
27:53.288 --> 27:54.450
For what?

344
27:54.450 --> 27:56.490
Fine. I'm sorry, then.

345
27:56.490 --> 27:59.050
I didn't mean to tell her that.

346
27:59.050 --> 28:03.577
I just didn't want to hurt my friend's feelings.

347
28:03.577 --> 28:05.400
That means...

348
28:06.010 --> 28:08.620
You and Bum like the same person?

349
28:11.466 --> 28:13.311
Dunk, is it?

350
28:16.970 --> 28:21.488
Since I already used your name as an excuse, can you hit on me?

351
28:28.820 --> 28:30.711
What did you just say?

352
28:31.570 --> 28:33.800
I know you heard me.

353
28:34.820 --> 28:38.170
Can you pretend you're hitting on me?

354
28:39.533 --> 28:41.710
And...

355
28:41.710 --> 28:44.000
Why would I do that?

356
28:45.280 --> 28:48.644
You asked me what I was mad at you about.

357
28:48.644 --> 28:50.511
And?

358
28:50.511 --> 28:55.533
If you pretend to hit on me, I'll let it go and stop being mad at you.

359
28:57.820 --> 29:00.288
Please? Just for a month.

360
29:00.288 --> 29:02.390
I'm only asking for a month.

361
29:03.130 --> 29:04.960
A month?

362
29:06.977 --> 29:09.080
Okay.

363
29:09.080 --> 29:11.620
And that means...?

364
29:14.150 --> 29:17.288
I'll hit on you.

365
29:35.820 --> 29:39.977
Do you two realize you've been acting really strange?

366
29:39.977 --> 29:44.044
Seriously, when did you and Jinna start talking?

367
29:44.733 --> 29:46.622
Well...

368
29:47.311 --> 29:50.266
Why? You're worried about your friend?

369
29:51.240 --> 29:52.666
I don't get it.

370
29:52.666 --> 29:54.440
I'm confused.

371
29:54.440 --> 29:56.960
Tell me I'm not dreaming.

372
29:56.960 --> 29:59.080
What dream?

373
29:59.080 --> 30:01.244
Fine! I believe now.

374
30:01.244 --> 30:03.480
You shook me so hard my brain's all upside down.

375
30:03.480 --> 30:05.710
Well, just in case you're still dreaming.

376
30:05.710 --> 30:10.177
From now on, I hope you don't mind if I hit on your buddy, okay?

377
30:10.177 --> 30:11.600
Sure.

378
30:11.600 --> 30:13.640
No problem.

379
30:14.230 --> 30:16.066
He's yours.

380
30:20.800 --> 30:22.600
Dig in.

381
30:24.820 --> 30:26.880
- So bland. - Yeah, so is my drink.

382
30:26.880 --> 30:28.820
What? Are you kidding me? Let me have a sip.

383
30:28.820 --> 30:31.222
Hey, you want my drink, don't you?

384
30:31.222 --> 30:35.088
Not a chance. I want to drink some Thai tea, too. Let's share.

385
30:35.088 --> 30:36.911
Podduang!

386
30:40.480 --> 30:42.680
I got you a bag of cocoa.

387
30:51.022 --> 30:53.977
When did they start flirting?

388
31:00.120 --> 31:01.530
My heart's about to stop.

389
31:01.530 --> 31:04.511
It's okay. I'll call for a rescue team.

390
31:05.900 --> 31:07.240
[Following]

391
31:07.240 --> 31:09.820
I think Podduang made the first move.

392
31:09.820 --> 31:11.210
You're wrong.

393
31:11.210 --> 31:15.133
From the looks of it, it was definitely Jinna.

394
31:15.133 --> 31:17.977
Do you know what physiological arousal fucking means?

395
31:17.977 --> 31:20.200
There's this thing about people who hate each other,

396
31:20.200 --> 31:23.250
where being in the same room makes their hearts start racing.

397
31:23.250 --> 31:28.244
They'll break into a sweat, turn red, and get an adrenaline rush.

398
31:28.244 --> 31:30.488
Podduang is an intern at the soccer club.

399
31:30.488 --> 31:33.170
He's bound to feel something.

400
31:33.170 --> 31:36.990
Gosh. You've got it all wrong, Tod.

401
31:36.990 --> 31:40.350
When it comes to this, it's either the right person or the wrong one.

402
31:40.350 --> 31:43.040
Podduang hates Jinna's guts.

403
31:43.040 --> 31:49.644
And you should stop it right now, with those silly theories you read in books.

404
31:50.770 --> 31:52.933
Jinna.

405
31:52.933 --> 31:55.250
Who made the first move?

406
31:56.022 --> 31:57.933
What the hell?

407
32:03.880 --> 32:05.800
I don't buy it.

408
32:06.440 --> 32:10.240
How many times do I have to tell you? Jinna really is hitting on me.

409
32:10.240 --> 32:13.120
Are you really okay with this? You hate his guts.

410
32:13.120 --> 32:17.360
Well, I... I want to open up to him.

411
32:17.360 --> 32:20.820
Didn't you two tell me he's not a bad guy?

412
32:20.820 --> 32:22.711
Jeez... And now you're acting all confused.

413
32:22.711 --> 32:25.510
Yeah. Believe what he said, Dunk.

414
32:25.510 --> 32:29.190
Fine. I'm still a bit shocked. I'm sorry.

415
32:29.190 --> 32:30.820
Nonsense.

416
32:30.820 --> 32:34.777
So, where are you two at now?

417
32:35.760 --> 32:39.320
It's not official yet. We're just seeing where things go.

418
32:39.320 --> 32:40.930
Sheesh...

419
32:40.930 --> 32:42.820
Is my friend about to get into a relationship?

420
32:42.820 --> 32:45.690
If that's the case, the rivalry between the two faculties is over.

421
32:45.690 --> 32:47.210
Now they're two loving faculties.

422
32:47.210 --> 32:48.350
Stop that now.

423
32:48.350 --> 32:51.090
When are you going to return my earphones?

424
32:51.090 --> 32:52.250
What? Come on...

425
32:52.250 --> 32:54.650
Got flustered, so you changed the subject?

426
32:54.650 --> 32:56.230
You're getting carried away.

427
32:56.230 --> 32:58.650
What's wrong, babe?

428
32:58.650 --> 33:00.820
You called me "babe"? Yuck.

429
33:00.820 --> 33:02.710
Don't call me that again. I don't like it.

430
33:02.710 --> 33:04.866
Just kidding.

431
33:04.866 --> 33:08.640
Yeah, I left them at my place. I'll return them later.

432
33:08.640 --> 33:10.440
You lost them, didn't you?

433
33:10.440 --> 33:12.390
Lost? That's ridiculous.

434
33:12.390 --> 33:14.820
I'll return them soon, Podduang.

435
33:14.820 --> 33:16.430
Always.

436
33:16.430 --> 33:19.533
Right. Have you seen Anda at all?

437
33:20.650 --> 33:23.755
I haven't seen him since the controversy.

438
33:24.330 --> 33:25.970
But things have gotten a lot better.

439
33:25.970 --> 33:27.990
People understand him a lot better now.

440
33:27.990 --> 33:30.970
Yeah. The world has changed a lot. Even I understand him.

441
33:32.480 --> 33:34.450
Glad things are turning around for him.

442
33:34.450 --> 33:36.680
I don't want him to stress out.

443
33:46.000 --> 33:46.830
[I don't know where Anda has gone,

444
33:46.830 --> 33:48.470
but we, the Andaman fandom, are always right here. #AndaAndHisSmile]

445
33:48.470 --> 33:50.888
[I love #AndaAndHisSmile so much.]

446
33:50.888 --> 33:52.044
[The Andaman fandom,

447
33:52.044 --> 33:53.290
please show him our support. #AndaAndHisSmile]

448
33:53.290 --> 33:55.800
[Is the #AndaAndHisSmile necessary for a gay person dating someone?]

449
33:55.800 --> 33:57.660
[None of your business. If you can't think of anything positive,

450
33:57.660 --> 33:58.880
then shut up. #AndaAndHisSmile]

451
33:58.880 --> 34:00.560
[People leaving rude comments are just jealous.]

452
34:00.560 --> 34:04.320
[Did no one ever love them? #AndaAndHisSmile]

453
34:05.000 --> 34:08.080
[Bum: I'm so happy our hashtag has reached number one on the trending list]

454
34:08.080 --> 34:11.080
[Podduang: Muah, muah]

455
34:13.520 --> 34:16.320
On this episode of 'Woody Talk, ' we're with Anda,

456
34:16.320 --> 34:19.740
a renowned actor who's at the center of attention right now.

457
34:19.740 --> 34:24.560
What would make you go public? How do you feel?

458
34:24.560 --> 34:27.320
Are you a fan of Anda?

459
34:27.320 --> 34:28.860
Oh, yes.

460
34:28.860 --> 34:30.390
Same, actually.

461
34:30.390 --> 34:31.860
I also love the Andaman fandom.

462
34:31.860 --> 34:33.930
To respect yourself and others,

463
34:33.930 --> 34:36.155
- Can I watch this with you? - No problem.

464
34:36.155 --> 34:38.330
What made you decide to make such a bold move?

465
34:38.330 --> 34:41.555
- He's adorable, isn't he? - He really is.

466
34:41.555 --> 34:44.680
How long have you been his fan?

467
34:44.680 --> 34:47.720
About two or three years. What about you?

468
34:47.720 --> 34:51.440
Same for me, actually. About that long, too.

469
34:51.440 --> 34:56.030
But it's a shame he's been getting so much hate lately.

470
34:56.030 --> 35:00.280
These toxic netizens who just keep hating are out of their minds, aren't they?

471
35:00.280 --> 35:03.000
- Yeah. - I feel so bad for him.

472
35:03.000 --> 35:06.800
You didn't press the button?

473
35:06.800 --> 35:09.110
I got distracted.

474
35:09.110 --> 35:11.640
- Anda is just too adorable. - I'm sorry.

475
35:11.640 --> 35:13.640
Perfect timing.

476
35:17.650 --> 35:19.620
He's cute, isn't he?

477
35:22.120 --> 35:24.600
And when Anda acted with James...

478
35:24.600 --> 35:28.088
Look, this beach scene is just so great.

479
35:28.088 --> 35:29.510
I saved this one too.

480
35:29.510 --> 35:32.010
- Really? - It's such a beautiful scene.

481
35:32.010 --> 35:34.820
This is my room.

482
35:34.820 --> 35:37.050
We're basically neighbors.

483
35:37.050 --> 35:40.000
Hey! Are you kidding me?

484
35:40.000 --> 35:42.820
But we've never seen each other before, have we?

485
35:42.820 --> 35:45.340
You're right. What a coincidence.

486
35:45.340 --> 35:47.000
Right. My name is Amp.

487
35:47.000 --> 35:49.640
If you have any problems, feel free to knock on my door.

488
35:49.640 --> 35:53.000
My name is Podduang. You can also simply call me "Pod."

489
35:53.000 --> 35:55.340
Okay. See you.

490
35:55.340 --> 35:57.370
Right. Bye-bye.

491
36:13.160 --> 36:15.880
[JINNA] [Hello]

492
36:30.830 --> 36:33.630
It's hard to live as a celebrity, isn't it?

493
36:35.300 --> 36:38.480
Even admitting who you like feels like a crime.

494
36:41.970 --> 36:44.220
Are you okay?

495
36:45.240 --> 36:47.830
I heard you had it rough.

496
36:47.830 --> 36:50.311
I was too scared to message you.

497
36:50.311 --> 36:53.000
I was afraid you weren't ready to open up.

498
36:54.830 --> 36:57.000
It was brutal, actually.

499
36:58.240 --> 37:01.960
Why is it so hard to be myself?

500
37:04.000 --> 37:08.711
Because our lives don't simply depend on us, Anda.

501
37:11.340 --> 37:13.300
You're right.

502
37:15.250 --> 37:17.900
Ever since I made the announcement,

503
37:19.420 --> 37:22.630
I feel like I'm completely lost.

504
37:23.600 --> 37:26.510
So lost that sometimes I ask myself

505
37:26.510 --> 37:31.222
if I've actually slipped up.

506
37:32.630 --> 37:35.390
My company even warned me.

507
37:37.840 --> 37:40.000
Even worse,

508
37:40.980 --> 37:45.266
my manager told me that...

509
37:45.266 --> 37:48.755
all the upcoming series we were supposed to shoot

510
37:49.590 --> 37:52.400
have been put on hold.

511
37:57.270 --> 38:01.100
On top of that, someone sent me that freaky doll, too.

512
38:02.240 --> 38:05.688
Do that many people really hate me, Jinna?

513
38:06.400 --> 38:08.610
I'm so tired, Jinna.

514
38:11.220 --> 38:13.310
I'm so tired.

515
38:17.680 --> 38:19.960
Then come back to us.

516
38:21.810 --> 38:24.880
I've known you for three years,

517
38:27.510 --> 38:30.733
and you're certainly loved by so many more people.

518
38:31.560 --> 38:34.160
I don't mean to get all emotional,

519
38:35.488 --> 38:37.400
but like...

520
38:38.440 --> 38:43.044
I've gotten to know so many people since I started working as an actor.

521
38:44.120 --> 38:47.330
But you three are the only ones

522
38:47.330 --> 38:50.200
I can really talk to you about everything.

523
38:53.000 --> 38:54.960
Right.

524
38:54.960 --> 38:57.500
Art, Tod, and I are always here.

525
39:02.100 --> 39:07.488
Everything is just piling up on me and I have no idea where to even start.

526
39:08.060 --> 39:12.110
My family wasn't okay with my announcement either.

527
39:12.110 --> 39:15.800
They haven't been okay with me being an actor from day one.

528
39:18.030 --> 39:19.933
Anda.

529
39:22.180 --> 39:25.610
Someday, your family will appreciate your effort.

530
39:28.190 --> 39:30.840
One step at a time, okay?

531
39:38.222 --> 39:40.030
Anda.

532
39:41.680 --> 39:45.022
You're looking really run-down these days.

533
39:45.022 --> 39:47.044
Don't forget to make some time to rest.

534
39:47.044 --> 39:49.120
I'm worried about you.

535
39:49.120 --> 39:51.610
So are Tod and Art.

536
39:52.310 --> 39:54.340
Thank you.

537
40:00.190 --> 40:02.610
It's okay, it's okay.

538
40:04.840 --> 40:07.200
- What class do you have today, Jinna? - Hey.

539
40:07.200 --> 40:09.100
- Professor Bankpan is so strict. - I'm done.

540
40:09.100 --> 40:10.620
I don't want to study with him at all.

541
40:10.620 --> 40:13.160
He really is.

542
40:13.160 --> 40:15.280
That's Podduang and Bum.

543
40:15.280 --> 40:17.480
- I'll be right back. - I wonder who he's seeing.

544
40:17.480 --> 40:20.200
Showing his true colors already.

545
40:20.200 --> 40:22.540
Hello.

546
40:22.540 --> 40:23.810
Hello to whom?

547
40:23.810 --> 40:25.810
Me?

548
40:25.810 --> 40:27.640
Or that girl?

549
40:29.810 --> 40:32.222
What? Jealous?

550
40:33.080 --> 40:34.700
I'm here too, you know?

551
40:34.700 --> 40:36.400
What's with all the sweet talk?

552
40:36.400 --> 40:40.155
- You didn't reply to my DMs. - I'd already fallen asleep.

553
40:41.810 --> 40:45.360
This is Risa, a scholarship student in Accounting.

554
40:45.360 --> 40:47.460
We go back to freshman year.

555
40:47.460 --> 40:49.260
Hello, Podduang and Bum.

556
40:49.260 --> 40:52.266
I'm Risa. Nice to meet you all.

557
40:55.550 --> 40:58.422
Right. I have a class to attend.

558
40:58.422 --> 40:59.950
We're running late, too.

559
40:59.950 --> 41:03.400
- Let's go. - Hey, hold on.

560
41:03.400 --> 41:05.960
- Bye-bye. - Bye-bye.

561
41:05.960 --> 41:08.240
Hurry. We're late.

562
41:08.240 --> 41:10.810
They all seem very friendly.

563
41:10.810 --> 41:12.620
Well, isn't that nice?

564
41:12.620 --> 41:14.440
Who would want to be like you anyway?

565
41:14.440 --> 41:15.550
[Faculty of Engineering]

566
41:15.550 --> 41:17.680
Should we have steak at our usual place?

567
41:17.680 --> 41:19.150
Anda is here after all.

568
41:19.150 --> 41:20.810
- Let's go. - I'm in.

569
41:20.810 --> 41:22.022
But I think...

570
41:22.022 --> 41:24.510
Anda probably wants to go to our favorite shabu-shabu place, right?

571
41:24.510 --> 41:25.777
That's a good idea.

572
41:25.777 --> 41:26.580
- Art. - What?

573
41:26.580 --> 41:28.810
Do you really have to oppose everything I say?

574
41:28.810 --> 41:32.320
Come on. It's called "presenting an option."

575
41:32.320 --> 41:34.670
I'm fine with anything, actually.

576
41:34.670 --> 41:38.360
But shabu-shabu might be a better choice?

577
41:38.360 --> 41:39.933
- Steak is better. - Shabu-shabu.

578
41:39.933 --> 41:41.120
- Steak. - Shabu-shabu.

579
41:41.120 --> 41:41.670
Steak.

580
41:41.670 --> 41:42.777
- I've got it. - Shabu-shabu.

581
41:42.777 --> 41:44.644
Shabu-shabu?

582
41:45.270 --> 41:46.500
A pad kaphrao place near campus.

583
41:46.500 --> 41:48.440
- Oh... - Oh, come on.

584
41:48.440 --> 41:49.666
Seriously?

585
41:49.666 --> 41:51.720
Come on, let's go.

586
41:52.333 --> 41:54.440
Anda.

587
41:54.440 --> 41:55.810
We need to talk.

588
41:55.810 --> 41:57.390
Hey, wait a minute.

589
41:57.390 --> 41:58.660
Who are you?

590
41:58.660 --> 42:00.840
We need to talk, just the two of us.

591
42:00.840 --> 42:01.940
Just talk about it here.

592
42:01.940 --> 42:03.500
Why do you need to talk to him alone?

593
42:03.500 --> 42:04.533
Just tell us.

594
42:04.533 --> 42:06.711
Can you stay the fuck away?

595
42:09.980 --> 42:11.190
Art, calm down.

596
42:11.190 --> 42:13.590
- Let me talk. - Calm down, calm down.

597
42:13.590 --> 42:17.120
Listen to him. Let's not make any sudden moves.

598
42:17.120 --> 42:18.933
Wait and see.

599
42:23.460 --> 42:26.330
Why are you so fucking selfish, Anda?

600
42:26.330 --> 42:30.020
Why did you have to ruin someone else's life too?

601
42:30.020 --> 42:34.460
Do you know the company didn't just put your series on hold?

602
42:34.460 --> 42:36.200
This affects me, too.

603
42:36.200 --> 42:38.960
We're the lead partners.

604
42:38.960 --> 42:42.600
Why did you have to ruin my life as well?

605
42:43.920 --> 42:45.866
James, I'm deeply sorry.

606
42:45.866 --> 42:48.110
Sorry.

607
42:48.110 --> 42:50.630
Sorry for fucking what?

608
42:50.630 --> 42:55.510
Back then, I liked you because I really did.

609
42:55.510 --> 42:57.320
When you rejected me,

610
42:57.320 --> 43:01.600
I respected your choice, but I never mixed this shit with work!

611
43:02.320 --> 43:05.955
I didn't do it because I was uncomfortable with you.

612
43:06.640 --> 43:11.822
I just didn't want to pretend and keep lying to people. That's all!

613
43:12.740 --> 43:15.177
What about our partner projects?

614
43:15.177 --> 43:18.800
You can't just be whoever the fuck you want to be.

615
43:18.800 --> 43:22.200
Aren't you being too selfish, Anda?

616
43:23.070 --> 43:29.030
With this kind of stuff, there are seniors and businesses tied to it.

617
43:29.030 --> 43:32.360
I just want you and me to make the most of it.

618
43:32.360 --> 43:34.820
Once it's over, you can flirt with or sleep with whoever you want!

619
43:34.820 --> 43:37.820
James, calm down!

620
43:37.820 --> 43:41.720
Are you that thirsty for a sexual partner?

621
43:41.720 --> 43:43.600
I never knew you'd be like this.

622
43:43.600 --> 43:46.511
- And so fucking what, Anda? - Hey!

623
43:49.630 --> 43:51.690
Seems like you've got a problem.

624
43:51.690 --> 43:54.160
Hey, you.

625
43:54.160 --> 43:58.422
I hope you don't do something stupid on our turf,

626
43:58.422 --> 44:02.977
with our tools and our friends around.

627
44:06.610 --> 44:10.670
Leave now if you don't want to make the headlines.

628
44:10.670 --> 44:16.066
You... All of you better get used to fucking dealing with me.

629
44:24.250 --> 44:25.690
Hey.

630
44:25.690 --> 44:28.080
Hey, listen to me.

631
44:28.080 --> 44:31.022
- Hey! - Hands off!

632
44:31.022 --> 44:33.110
Leave already.

633
44:33.110 --> 44:35.650
- I don't want to see you anymore. - No.

634
44:35.650 --> 44:40.350
I'm here because I want to hear you say that you hate me.

635
44:40.350 --> 44:41.490
Yes.

636
44:41.490 --> 44:43.955
Tell him, "I hate you!"

637
44:46.590 --> 44:48.570
- Please listen to me. - No!

638
44:48.570 --> 44:50.820
- Hey. - I hate you.

639
44:50.820 --> 44:53.250
I hate you! Are you satisfied now?

640
44:53.250 --> 44:56.130
I really am!

641
45:11.520 --> 45:13.990
But I didn't order anything.

642
45:13.990 --> 45:17.933
I've got this for you. I think you'll like it.

643
45:20.288 --> 45:22.022
What is it?

644
45:22.022 --> 45:25.680
Open it. I want to see your reactions.

645
45:27.280 --> 45:29.360
I only asked you to pretend to flirt with me, you know?

646
45:29.360 --> 45:31.977
You don't have to go this far.

647
45:38.570 --> 45:40.910
Where did you get this?

648
45:42.820 --> 45:44.970
Hey, Anda.

649
45:44.970 --> 45:46.920
I need your help.

650
46:05.450 --> 46:08.555
I'm sorry, I didn't mean it.

651
46:09.600 --> 46:11.400
It's okay.

652
46:24.160 --> 46:26.000
I have to go now.

653
46:28.550 --> 46:32.133
Hey. This is your room.

654
46:33.820 --> 46:35.644
Bye-bye.

655
47:03.280 --> 47:08.360
[Mentioned you in their story. So cute!] [Add to your story]

656
47:42.800 --> 47:44.040
Jinna.

657
47:44.040 --> 47:46.640
I really like you.

658
47:46.640 --> 47:48.755
What the hell? That came out of nowhere.

659
47:48.755 --> 47:52.000
You know how hot Jinna is, right?

660
47:52.000 --> 47:54.560
I only want you to pretend to hit on me. Don't get too attached.

661
47:54.560 --> 47:56.060
I don't like pretending, though.

662
47:56.060 --> 47:59.920
You've been practicing hard today, so I got you some water.

663
47:59.920 --> 48:01.320
For me?

664
48:01.320 --> 48:04.640
This award is for you all.

665
48:04.640 --> 48:06.060
[Team Anda]

666
48:06.060 --> 48:08.620
You're standing here arguing with me nonstop,

667
48:08.620 --> 48:11.880
and you actually expect me to be proud of your stupid award?

668
48:11.880 --> 48:14.800
Will there be a day when my dad accepts me?

669
48:14.800 --> 48:18.420
At the end of the day, I feel like I can never truly be myself

670
48:18.420 --> 48:20.220
as long as I'm still alive.

671
48:20.220 --> 48:24.560
I just want to tell you that if you're hurting, just let it out.

672
48:24.560 --> 48:27.733
Don't worry about how people will see you.
